rget=\"_blank\" class=\"button-tertiary is-button-small w-button\">Sign Up</a></div></nav><div class=\"navbar_menu-button w-nav-button\"><div class=\"menu-icon1\"><div class=\"menu-icon1_line-top\"></div><div class=\"menu-icon1_line-middle\"><div class=\"menu-icon_line-middle-inner\"></div></div><div class=\"menu-icon1_line-bottom\"></div></div></div></div></div><main class=\"main-wrapper\"><header class=\"section-about-header\"><div class=\"page-padding\"><div class=\"container-medium\"><div class=\"padding-vertical padding-xhuge\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid about-header_component\"><div class=\"header1_content\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><h1 class=\"about_h1\">A trustworthy financial partner</h1></div><p class=\"text-size-medium\">Access up to $750 to prevent overdraft. No interest or fees.</p><div class=\"margin-top margin-medium\"><div class=\"button-row\"><div data-property-value=\"hello\" data-analytics=\"click\" id=\"w-node-a101ffb4-c453-58bb-241f-c766780ba079-780ba079\" data-wf--button-primary--variant=\"base\" class=\"button-wrapper\"><a add-params=\"true\" data-analytics=\"click\" data-property-event=\"join bree\" href=\"https://app.trybree.com/register\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"button w-button\">Join Bree</a><div class=\"button-background\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"about-header_image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc71efe2534d240db05fb2_About%20Illustration.png\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 48vw, (max-width: 2293px) 49vw, 1124px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc71efe2534d240db05fb2_About%20Illustration-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc71efe2534d240db05fb2_About%20Illustration-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc71efe2534d240db05fb2_About%20Illustration-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc71efe2534d240db05fb2_About%20Illustration.png 1124w\" alt=\"Illustration of different people going through regular life\"/></div></div></div></div></div></header><header data-w-id=\"99f237cc-bfad-f39c-4119-3d0c0cd25020\" class=\"section-mission\"><div class=\"page-padding\"><div class=\"container-medium\"><div class=\"mission_component\"><h2 class=\"mission_h2\">Our Mission</h2><div class=\"mission_text-wrapper\"><p class=\"text-size-medium\">Many Canadians have little room between income deposits and expenses. Our current financial system made up of traditional banks, payday lenders and other private institutions don&#x27;t take proper care of your average consumer.<br/><br/>With satisfaction rates towards traditional financial institutions at all time lows, we wanted to build a better and friendlier financial partner for Canadians. We&#x27;re starting with what matters to you most - getting cash that you&#x27;ve earned in your hands earlier, so you can cover those unexpected bill payments or life events.<br/><br/>Access a line of credit of up to $750 today when you sign up for Bree. Say goodbye to interest payments and overdraft fees and build towards your financial freedom.</p></div><div class=\"mission_icon-wrapper is-1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc76db14bb9a472cb77b83_Money.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"money icon\" class=\"mission_icon\"/></div><div class=\"mission_icon-wrapper is-2\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc76dbdb94a0cb3bc0a1dc_Piggy%20Bank.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"flying piggy bank illustration\" class=\"mission_icon\"/></div><div class=\"mission_icon-wrapper is-3\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc76dbe9738ce4d0bbb5cf_Bag%20of%20money.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"bag of money illustration\" class=\"mission_icon\"/></div><div class=\"mission_icon-wrapper is-4\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc7867e9738cf023bbd149_Cloud%2002.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"cloud icon\" class=\"mission_icon is-cloud\"/></div><div class=\"mission_icon-wrapper is-5\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc78c6c9f4871d94bc42b3_Cloud%2011.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"cloud icon\" class=\"mission_icon is-cloud\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mission_background-wrapper\"><div class=\"shape_svg-contain is-white-top\"><div class=\"shape_embed w-embed\"><svg class=\"animate-svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 10\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"> <path class=\"animate-path\" data-path-to=\"M 0 0 C 35 21 70 0 100 0 L 0 0 Z\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" d=\"M 0 0 C 36.998 0.0211 70 0 100 0 L 0 0 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path> </svg></div></div><div class=\"mission_background-fill\"></div><div class=\"shape_svg-contain is-flipped\"><div class=\"shape_embed w-embed\"><svg class=\"animate-svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 10\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"> <path class=\"animate-path\" data-path-to=\"M 0 0 C 18 1 61 9 100 0 L 100 10 H 0 Z\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" d=\"M 0 0 C 29 6 78 17 100 0 L 100 10 H 0 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path> </svg></div></div></div></header><section class=\"section-benefits\"><div class=\"page-padding\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"padding-bottom padding-xhuge\"><div class=\"benefits_component\"><div class=\"benefits_header-wrapper\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-tiny\"><h2 class=\"heading-style-h1\">Our Core Values</h2></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid benefits_list\"><div id=\"w-node-e212960d-7b5d-ce19-0725-6da22506a3af-a082b026\" class=\"benefits_item\"><div class=\"benefits_content-wrapper is-red\"><div class=\"benefits_item-icon-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc731a1081fc43e58cac3c_Trust.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Trust icon\" class=\"icon-large\"/></div><div class=\"benefits_item-text-wrapper\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Trust</h3></div><p>We want to be the financial partner that you can rely on and trust.</p></div></div><div class=\"benefits_background is-red\"></div></div><div id=\"w-node-e212960d-7b5d-ce19-0725-6da22506a3ba-a082b026\" class=\"benefits_item\"><div class=\"benefits_content-wrapper is-yellow\"><div class=\"benefits_item-icon-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc731afeae6a04870e01af_Transparency.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Transparency Icon\" class=\"icon-large\"/></div><div class=\"benefits_item-text-wrapper\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Transparency</h3></div><p>We have no hidden fees. You&#x27;ll always know exactly what you&#x27;re paying.</p></div></div><div class=\"benefits_background is-yellow\"></div></div><div id=\"w-node-e212960d-7b5d-ce19-0725-6da22506a3c5-a082b026\" class=\"benefits_item\"><div class=\"benefits_content-wrapper is-blue\"><div class=\"benefits_item-icon-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62a208274b86c4b7ff256f88/62cc731aad8a382537445e06_Customers.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Handshake icon\" class=\"icon-large\"/></div><div class=\"benefits_item-text-wrapper\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Customer First</h3></div><p>Your satisfaction is our #1 priority. Our goal is to get you the best services at the most affordable prices.</p></div></div><div class=\"benefits_background is-blue\"></div></div></div><div class=\"margin-top margin-small\"><div id=\"w-node-b0ffd163-46af-f97a-4a0e-67b24fe3220b-4fe3220b\" class=\"button-wrapper\"><a add-params=\"true\" href=\"https://app.trybree.com/register\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"button-secondary w-button\">Join Bree</a><div class=\"button-background\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><div class=\"f